  "description": "A powerful .NET configuration provider for Google Cloud Secret Manager that enables\n      seamless secret management in your applications. Features include region-specific secret\n      handling, flexible filtering options, batch processing, automatic secret rotation, built-in\n      retry policies, and JSON value flattening support. Perfect for cloud-native applications\n      requiring secure and scalable secret management.",
